\newlabel{tab:primary}{{2}{12}{Complete primary comparison at 1024 pixels. Values are OBB \metric . Positive differences favor domain-anchored DINOv2 adaptation. The held test is reported as the observed AL test because it is not geographically or source-group independent}{table.caption.5}{}}
