\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Paired three-seed comparison of the matched 1024-pixel baseline and domain-anchored DINOv2 initialization. Lines connect identical random seeds. Anchored SSL increased the mean on validation and on the observed Alabama test, but one validation seed declined and both paired 95\% intervals include zero. The test panel is a held-file observation, not evidence of geographic generalization.}}{13}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:primary_paired}{{4}{13}{Paired three-seed comparison of the matched 1024-pixel baseline and domain-anchored DINOv2 initialization. Lines connect identical random seeds. Anchored SSL increased the mean on validation and on the observed Alabama test, but one validation seed declined and both paired 95\% intervals include zero. The test panel is a held-file observation, not evidence of geographic generalization}{figure.caption.6}{}}
