\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Qualitative oriented-detection behavior on two fixed Alabama validation images. Reference OBBs and predictions use the same class colors. The baseline and anchored models are the seed-42 frozen validation checkpoints, selected here by the median validation-effect rule; the scenes were selected by annotation content rather than model outcome. The panel is illustrative and does not replace the complete paired three-seed analysis.}}{14}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:qualitative_obb}{{5}{14}{Qualitative oriented-detection behavior on two fixed Alabama validation images. Reference OBBs and predictions use the same class colors. The baseline and anchored models are the seed-42 frozen validation checkpoints, selected here by the median validation-effect rule; the scenes were selected by annotation content rather than model outcome. The panel is illustrative and does not replace the complete paired three-seed analysis}{figure.caption.7}{}}
